.SH NAME
ivcap-project-revoke-capability - Revoke one or more capabilities from a project principal


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBivcap project revoke-capability project_id (--user  | --service ) --capability  ... [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Revoke individual project capabilities from a principal, leaving their remaining
capabilities intact. To remove a principal from the project entirely, use
\&'ivcap project remove-member'.


